            "detailed_description": "<strong>Jammerball</strong> is a sports game based on dodgeball and inspired by the classic arcade game Windjammers.<br><br>There are 8 teams in Jammerball, and all of them have their own unique arena. Each team has a specific weakness in some aspect of the game, with only two exceptions: one with no weaknesses, and one with all of them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playable teams</strong></h2><br>    Drunken Brothers (all weaknesses) – Drunken Dome<br>    Broken Wings (weak speed) – Wingless Garden<br>    The Scratchers (weak shooting potency) – Little Claw Palace<br>    Tired Spirits (weak energy recharging speed) – Yawning Center<br>    Exhausteds (weak total energy) – Weakness Palace<br>    Rubber Souls (weak resistance) – Bouncing Colliseum<br>    Soapy Hands (weak catching ability) – Slippery Ground<br>    Mighty Highers (no weaknesses) – The Very Best Garden<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><br>    3 Difficulty Levels<br>    Cooperative mode<br>    Versus mode (1vs1 &amp; 2vs2)<br>    8 different teams to play<br>    8 unique arenas",
